<h2>The post-chargesheet bail calculus</h2>
<p>Courts assessing regular bail after the investigation closes typically weigh a familiar cluster of factors, and the order in <em>Lokenath Saha</em> tracks them closely:</p>
<div class="tiles">
  <div class="tile"><strong>Investigation complete</strong><br>The chargesheet stood filed before the jurisdictional court — custodial interrogation was no longer in play.</div>
